{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.TopologicalMass.cat_descended_is_base_mass","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.TopologicalMass.cat_descended_is_base_mass","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":13,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.TopologicalMass.cat_descended_is_base_mass","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.TopologicalMass.cat_descended_is_base_mass","kind":"theorem","line":110,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/TopologicalMass/cat_descended_is_base_mass.lean#L110-L119","doc":"**Descended term equals the base-level mass**\n    ([`lem:topological-mass-cat-descended`]).\n\n`‖tr(τ̂ₙ(α))‖ = 𝔪(ϱ₀)`.  *Derived* (not assumed): rewrite the trace of\nthe descended integrand to the base-level trace (open input 1), then\nidentify its mass norm with the base-level mass (open input 2). ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:lem:topological-mass-cat-descended","label":"lem:topological-mass-cat-descended","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/topological-mass-cat-descended.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.TopologicalMass.CatDescended.base_mass_is_norm_of_base_trace","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.TopologicalMass.CatDescended.base_mass_is_norm_of_base_trace","kind":"theorem","line":93,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/TopologicalMass/cat_descended_is_base_mass.lean#L93-L105","doc":"**Open input 2 — the base mass is the norm of the base trace.**\n`‖tr₀(α₀)‖ = 𝔪(ϱ₀)`.  Needs the `*`-norm / mass infrastructure of\nthe base level (not formalised).\n\n**The body is `ctx.base_norm`, not a `sorry` (corrected 2026-09-03).**\nSame shape as `descended_trace_is_base_trace` above: the class docstrings\nthis field \"Open input 2\", so the accessor is the legitimate idiom and the\nobligation sits with the instantiator. `#print axioms` reports no\n`sorryAx`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.TopologicalMass.CatDescended.descended_trace_is_base_trace","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.TopologicalMass.CatDescended.descended_trace_is_base_trace","kind":"theorem","line":75,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/TopologicalMass/cat_descended_is_base_mass.lean#L75-L91","doc":"**Open input 1 — descent compatibility of the trace.**  The\nFrobenius trace of the descended integrand equals the base-level\ntrace of the descent: `tr(τ̂ₙ(α)) = tr₀(α₀)`.  Needs the\nlevel-`(n+1)` → base descent / Frobenius-trace infrastructure (not\nformalised).\n\n**The body is `ctx.trace_compat`, not a `sorry` (corrected 2026-09-03).**\n`#print axioms` reports no `sorryAx`. Here that is the *legitimate* shape\nrather than a defect: `CatDescendedInputs` docstrings this field \"Open\ninput 1\", so the class honestly names it as an assumption and this theorem\nis an accessor exposing it under a readable name — Mathlib's\n`Group.mul_assoc := Group.mul_assoc` idiom. The obligation is real and sits\nwith whoever instantiates the class; it is simply not discharged here. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.TopologicalMass.CatDescended.CatDescendedInputs.base_norm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.TopologicalMass.CatDescended.CatDescendedInputs.base_norm","kind":"theorem","line":73,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/TopologicalMass/cat_descended_is_base_mass.lean#L73-L73","doc":"Open input 2 ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.TopologicalMass.CatDescended.CatDescendedInputs.trace_compat","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.TopologicalMass.CatDescended.CatDescendedInputs.trace_compat","kind":"theorem","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/TopologicalMass/cat_descended_is_base_mass.lean#L71-L71","doc":"Open input 1 ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.TopologicalMass.CatDescended.CatDescendedInputs.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.TopologicalMass.CatDescended.CatDescendedInputs.mk","kind":"ctor","line":69,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/TopologicalMass/cat_descended_is_base_mass.lean#L69-L69","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.TopologicalMass.CatDescended.CatDescendedInputs","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.TopologicalMass.CatDescended.CatDescendedInputs","kind":"class","line":69,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/TopologicalMass/cat_descended_is_base_mass.lean#L69-L73","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.TopologicalMass.CatDescended.baseMass","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.TopologicalMass.CatDescended.baseMass","kind":"opaque","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/TopologicalMass/cat_descended_is_base_mass.lean#L66-L67","doc":"The base-level mass `𝔪(ϱ₀)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.TopologicalMass.CatDescended.baseTrace","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.TopologicalMass.CatDescended.baseTrace","kind":"opaque","line":63,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/TopologicalMass/cat_descended_is_base_mass.lean#L63-L64","doc":"The base-level trace `tr₀(α₀)` of the descended cycle `ϱ₀`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.TopologicalMass.CatDescended.mnorm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.TopologicalMass.CatDescended.mnorm","kind":"opaque","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/TopologicalMass/cat_descended_is_base_mass.lean#L60-L61","doc":"Mass norm `‖·‖` (archimedean). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.TopologicalMass.CatDescended.trFrob","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.TopologicalMass.CatDescended.trFrob","kind":"opaque","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/TopologicalMass/cat_descended_is_base_mass.lean#L57-L58","doc":"Frobenius categorical trace `tr` at level `n + 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.TopologicalMass.CatDescended.tauHat","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.TopologicalMass.CatDescended.tauHat","kind":"opaque","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/TopologicalMass/cat_descended_is_base_mass.lean#L54-L55","doc":"Descent involution `τ̂ₙ` on the level-`(n+1)` integrand. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.TopologicalMass.CatDescended.alpha","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.TopologicalMass.CatDescended.alpha","kind":"opaque","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/TopologicalMass/cat_descended_is_base_mass.lean#L50-L52","doc":"Categorical mass integrand `α = (∫_A ⊗ id) ∘ Δ ∘ ϱ` at level\n`n + 1` (modelled in the observation algebra, here `ℝ`). ","signatureChunk":0}]}